==English==
[[Image:Nunavut-map.png|thumb|alt=Nunavut is the Canadian territory that lies east of the Northwest Territories and north of Manitoba. Much of it is north of Ontario and Quebec too.|Nunavut's location in Canada]]
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|iu|nunavut||our land}}/{{m|iu|ᓄᓇᕗᑦ}}. Compare {{cog|kl|nunarput||our country, Greenland}}.

